WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.040
Taito...

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.810
See, you <i>do</i> have it in ya.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.860
What is this menacing energy?

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:20.920
That's it. That's the hate you were lacking!

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:28.870
How many centuries has it been since
the stars of Alkaid and Dubhe have appeared?

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.770
This is exciting!

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.510
--Ryuko!
--Senior Soei! Let's go!

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.710
So the star has become active...

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.740
Scary!

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.160
Not bad.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.260
Even after just awakening the Alkaid
has tremendous destructive power.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.490
However...

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:35.070
You've still got a long way to go
to stand up to my boss Keiro,

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.970
who bears the karma of Dubhe--!

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:45.980
He's fast! Has he improved
in this short of a time?

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.940
Wh-what?!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:11.340
T-Taito! Laila!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:20.290
My star is resonating!
Don't tell me that pattern is...!

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.460
Yes, the pattern of Alkaid.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:27.290
Taito bears the karma of the star Alkaid.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:31.060
Oh, wonderful! Is the party finally starting?

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.000
Senior Soei, get Lady Laila!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.370
Sir Taito appears to be reacting to my star!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.640
Understood!

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.840
Laila! Laila!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.480
What on earth?!

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.590
He's avoiding her...

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.990
Despite losing himself to his anger,
he seeks to prevent injury to Laila.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.220
N-now you've done it...!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.660
Laila! Say something, Laila!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.440
Father...

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.540
Laila...

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:20.950
Wh-where am I? Wh-where is Taito?

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.280
Taito!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.590
T-Taito...

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:31.560
Consumed by the star's power,
he has lost all control.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.560
What I feared has finally come to pass...

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.360
Don't tell me that power is...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.560
If so, you'll destroy yourself, Sir Taito!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.900
You leave me no choice.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.280
Don't die, now!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.620
What?!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.060
M-monster...

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.570
What are you doing, Taito?!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.340
Laila!

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:21.130
You're in danger, Lady Laila! Get away!

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.400
You're always causing everyone trouble...

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.520
Please...

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.150
...go back to normal, you stupid brother!

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.010
Oww!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.510
What's the big idea, Laila?!
What's the big idea, Laila?!

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.280
Why did you say that twice?!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.510
What is this?!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:06.320
Why am I covered in blood?!
Why am I covered in blood?! Why?!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.050
Quit repeating yourself!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:12.220
That... can't be...

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.490
So she stopped the Alkaid...

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.840
Why do I have to do this by myself?

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:33.070
Did I <i>really</i> do this?!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.860
Thank you for trying to stop Taito, umm...

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.930
I am Ryuko, an ascetic monk
from the Tong You Temple.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:54.100
I was sent here by Head Priest Ryusho.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.030
Then you came all the way from the capital?!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:59.240
Never did I expect something
like this awaited me.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:01.270
Perhaps this is also the karma of the stars.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:02.940
Karma of the stars?

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.040
In this world there are people who are born

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.550
bearing the karma of the stars
as ordained by the heavens.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:13.450
I, as well as Sir Taito,
bear the karma of the stars.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:18.890
My father always said
he didn't want Taito to awaken.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:24.200
He wanted him to live
peacefully as a normal person.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:27.030
So this is what he meant...

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.570
In the heavens are seven stars.
They are the stars of the Big Dipper.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.800
The seven stars:

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.110
In other words, the heroes
who are the Dipper Bearers;

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:37.980
the karma in place since Creation;

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.580
the transmigration of the wild gods;

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.250
the tales of warriors.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.250
And, just as in this world
there are yin and yang,

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.750
so too are there the opposite poles
of Dubhe and Alkaid in the Big Dipper.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.960
These two are "wild stars" that
hold complete sway over the land.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.960
That's from the Tale of the Big Dipper.

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:55.890
Indeed.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:07:01.570
The Dipper Bearers are seven heroes
born in turbulent times who will lead the people.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:05.630
It is said that each possesses the pattern
of a star in the Big Dipper upon their bodies.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:12.580
Five of the Dipper Bearers; Megrez,
Merak, Alioth, Phecda, and Mizar,

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.810
are known as the Five Divine Warriors.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:19.580
And the stars of Alkaid and Dubhe
are known as the Two Celestial Deities.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.790
Two Celestial Deities...

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.360
And I'm this Alkaid of yours?

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.420
What a joke!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:27.490
Taito!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.360
Sheesh. Even after everything you did...

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.260
I don't know if I should
call you carefree or stupid...

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.670
What did you say?!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:38.870
Ryuko, was it?! Are you trying to pick a fight?!

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.540
Knock it off, Taito.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:46.210
The Two Celestial Deities are sinful
stars that bring turmoil to the land.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:50.780
And it is the karma of the Five Divine Warriors
to act as breakwaters for that turmoil.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.220
So what?!

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.550
I also bear a star.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:58.690
The star of Mizar. I am one
of the Five Divine Warriors.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.460
So?!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.530
I don't care about any of this
stupid "karma" stuff! I'm me!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:06.360
I don't take orders or directions from anyone!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:14.240
No one can defy karma bestowed by the stars
in the heavens; it is a heavenly mandate.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:17.140
You are no exception, Taito.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.370
Grandpa Son...

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:45.270
Lord Keiro of the Xian Empire, staying here
on his way home from crushing a rebellion...

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.030
Frightening.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:53.240
I see. So he survived.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:57.420
Even the Mizar of the Five
Divine Warriors showed up.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.610
My best clothes went to waste as a result.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.520
So, what now? Devouring each other
is what the Alkaid and Dubhe do.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.960
--For you--
--Forget about him.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.030
The heavens have ordered that he should live.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.860
You're going to forget about him?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:17.400
But, Shimei. What <i>you</i> do is your own business.

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:20.610
I see. I get your drift.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:25.040
Alkaid... Just how much of an
obstacle will you be in my path?

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:43.590
It's cheap! Come and get some!
Plucked this very morning!

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.270
It's Taito!

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.070
Good morning, Taito!

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:50.270
Let's play!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.570
Morning! Let's go fishing
some other time, okay?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.970
--Yeah!
--We'll hold you to that!

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:58.080
Wait for me!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.750
The people of Tai Shan certainly are strong.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.750
The town is already so lively
after being burned down...

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:08.250
Did you think it would be gloomier
and wearier because it's a town for refugees?

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.160
No, that isn't what I...

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.490
You're a straightforward person, Ryuko.

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:17.930
Dad and Grandpa Son built this town
for refugees. Don't nitpick about it.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:22.130
That wasn't my intent. I respect them
both from the bottom of my heart.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.300
Good, then.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:27.930
These people are my friends. My family.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:54.620
We'll be back again, Kanyo... Everyone...

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.970
This many Qing Long Platoon members
and ascetic monks in one night...

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:05.970
Because they're friends...
Because they're family...

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:11.580
That mustached bastard will pay!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:15.320
As leader of the Qing Long
Platoon, I order you...

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.690
Father!

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.660
Don't even <i>think</i> about getting revenge.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.430
The Qing Long Platoon is the self-defense
force that protects Tai Shan.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.730
I will not allow it to launch
an attack of its own!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.600
You can't be serious!
You want us to just accept it?!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:30.940
You want us to accept defeat
with our tail between our legs?!

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.070
Be quiet!

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:38.070
Nothing comes from anger and hatred.
Do you understand, Taito?

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.080
What do you say we train?
We haven't in a while.

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.610
<i>He's fast! Is it because he's awoken?!</i>

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.780
I'm leaving your change of clothes here!

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.320
This feels great!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:33.900
Taito.

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:34.770
Huh?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:39.740
I'm hoping that you will someday take over
as leader of the Qing Long Platoon.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.240
Yep, I plan to!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.140
What brought that on all of a sudden?
You're acting weird, Dad.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:48.940
I see.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.190
Hey, Dad.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:02.290
Yes?

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:05.000
Do you know a man named Keiro?

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:09.600
Keiro? Do you mean General
Keiro of the Xian Empire?

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.300
<i>An imperial general?!</i>

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:18.110
--What about him--?
--Gimme money, Dad! Money!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.110
--Money?
--I'm going to the capital!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:25.010
I'm going to kick the crap
out of Keiro, that mustached freak!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.990
That's crazy! It's sheer stupidity!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.890
Well, he <i>is</i> stupid!

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.130
It <i>is</i> quite like Taito.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:40.030
Actually, I want to visit the capital too!

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.000
How can you be so carefree?

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.740
To think that an imperial general set Tai Shan
ablaze and attacked Lian Tong Temple...

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.370
Could the emperor have sent him?

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.640
No, Keiro was likely acting on his own.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.150
The Xian Jia Lan Wu
is the proof of imperial status;

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:57.420
he probably stole it in order
to take the throne for himself.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:14:01.090
You can't be serious. A general
wanting to become emperor?

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:06.020
What if he was the Dubhe,
one of the Two Celestial Deities?

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:06.820
What?!

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:12.000
Impossible! I heard that the Alkaid
and Dubhe never appear at the same time!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.730
There is no doubt about it.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:21.610
Because of their tremendous power,
the Alkaid and the Dubhe

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.680
can prove to be either very
fortunate or very unfortunate.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:28.670
And fighting each other
is the karma of the two stars.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:33.050
You're saying I should let Taito go?

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.350
If the stars destine it so.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.750
Personally, I don't want to let him.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:49.200
Ryuko. I actually asked you
to the Lian Tong Temple

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.540
so that I could ask you
to be Taito's watchdog.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.940
Watchdog?

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:58.140
Although the Alkaid, he is still a child.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.380
As one of the Five Divine Warriors,
would you be willing

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:05.120
to show him the way and keep him
from straying from his path?

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:08.880
If such is my karma. However...

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.490
The Five Divine Warriors are breakwaters.

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.650
My karma is to prevent the two stars from
colliding and bringing disturbance to the land.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.330
Even if it means defeating Sir Taito!

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:37.080
If I lose, I have to forget
about the mustached bastard

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.020
and live here in Tai Shan
for the rest of my life?

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:44.760
Sounds good to me!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:46.120
My thanks.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:53.760
Here I come! Ryuko, an ascetic monk
of the Liu Jia sect's Tong You Temple
who uses the Eight Great Styles!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.630
That's not fair! Weapons are allowed?!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:16:00.710
There are no fights in this world on fair terms.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:05.710
The Dipper Bearers all carry
weapons that match their attributes.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.210
As the Mizar, this Luo Chuan Staff
acts as arm and leg to me!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:11.200
Oh, that so?

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:21.160
I am Taito, a freeloader of the Liu Jia
sect's Lian Tong Temple and also
a user of the Eight Great Styles!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.530
My fists are my weapon!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.710
Th-that shock wave...

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:38.310
Energy Manipulation.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.750
A secret Eight Great Styles technique

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.040
in which you control the energy flowing
in your body and place it into your weapon.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.890
Last time it was a tree branch,
but today it is the Luo Chuan Staff.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.880
I'll knock you out in one blow!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:09.510
<i>So he can use Energy Manipulation?!</i>

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.780
Wh-who are you knocking out now?!

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:15.510
<i>He's channeling his energy not through</i>
<i>a weapon, but his own body</i>...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.380
Foolishness!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:20.370
Don't underestimate me!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.640
Father.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.480
Laila?

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.880
Listen, Father. I have a favor to ask.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.540
I have a favor to ask of you as well.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.570
Never did I expect you
to stop it with your bare hands...

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.140
I want to have another fight with you...

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.500
Yes...

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.940
A draw doesn't count as a loss, right?

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.470
I'm going to the capital.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:38.660
Do you still have business with me?

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.430
I will accompany you to the capital.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.170
I'm your watchdog.

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:50.170
After all, if I let you go now,
there's no telling what trouble you'll cause.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.870
Do whatever you want.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.110
What are you doing, Laila?!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:58.280
Ha! You couldn't steal a march
on me in a hundred years!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.620
I'm coming too!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:00.820
Huh?!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:06.160
I can't just let you go! You're stupid
and slow and reckless and voracious!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.390
Men are so hopeless!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.630
U-umm, I'm a man too...

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:15.730
You think you can say whatever you want...!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:19.730
This has nothing to do with
you, Laila! Get out of here!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.400
Money. Were you planning
on traveling flat-broke?

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.010
Who's going to sew your ripped clothes?

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.750
And this is from Father.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:34.180
He says he'll let you borrow it,
so make sure you bring it back.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:38.990
Now that it's decided, let's go!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:43.890
Hey! Don't act bossy! Don't act bossy!

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.660
I guess the karma of the stars cannot be bent...

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:50.600
Even though we're not connected
by blood, Taito is still my son.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.040
I wanted to stop him.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:57.380
I've put you through a lot
with Taito and now Laila...

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:03.510
There was no choice. Laila has the ability
to quiet the Alkaid inside Taito.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:07.250
No one can defy heavenly mandate or karma.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:14.090
But, Taito. It is your will and strength
that determine your own destiny...

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.260
<i>The journey brings us face-to-face</i>
<i>with a heartless reality</i>.

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:29.700
<i>Only the rotten bastards get to survive</i>
<i>while the innocent people die?!</i>

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.300
<i>That's a load of crap!</i>

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.240
<i>If you cannot at least control</i>
<i>the flow of your own energy,</i>

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.940
<i>you do not stand a chance</i>.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:38.280
<i>Taito, huh? I'll be sure to remember you!</i>

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:42.380
<i>I absolutely refuse to abandon</i>
<i>you now! I refuse to!</i>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.280
<i>As the people face a crisis,</i>
<i>the friendship between the two blazes up!</i>

